t temperature histories","id":"AC-11.1","level":"ui","then":"the screen shows separate rows or records with each unit's returned quantity, history, and budget values","when":"a user opens the lot's handling-unit view"}],"ears":"When portions of received stock have different temperature histories, the Meridian responsive web app shall show them as separate handling units with their returned quantity, history, and tier-budget use and remaining.","id":"REQ-11","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-6","I-8","I-9","I-13","I-14","Q-5"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Warehouse Operator moves stock between shelves or cold rooms","id":"AC-12.1","level":"ui","then":"the request includes the source and destination and the screen shows the returned movement record with actor, time, and quantity fields","when":"the operator submits the move and opens its result"}],"ears":"The Meridian responsive web app shall provide stock-movement forms and show the returned movement record with source and destination locations, quantity, actor, and time.","id":"REQ-12","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9"],"stability":0.3333333333333333},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Customer Administrator opens address management","id":"AC-13.1","level":"ui","then":"the screen shows the address list or status returned by the API","when":"the administrator adds, edits, or removes an address"},{"given":"A System Administrator changes minimum remaining shelf life for a customer organisation","id":"AC-13.2","level":"ui","then":"the request includes the organisation-level value and the screen shows the saved value and response status returned by the API","when":"the change is submitted"},{"given":"A customer user or Dispatcher opens an order form","id":"AC-13.3","level":"ui","then":"the screen shows the organisation's minimum remaining shelf-life value without a control to change it per order","when":"the form renders"}],"ears":"The Meridian responsive web app shall let Customer Administrators maintain their organisation's 